WEBVTT

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:04.940
Exhausted from his fierce battle against 
Syun Kurosaki, Sora was hospitalized.

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:07.420
While we were waiting for him to recover...

00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:14.760
Yuya?

00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:17.360
I want to ask you something.

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:18.860
You!

00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:22.480
Contact headquarters immediately and 
tell them that Sora Shiunin has escaped!

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:23.120
Understood!

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:26.000
Fusion Summon!

00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:30.800
Sora...

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:33.210
That's...

00:00:36.020 --> 00:00:37.760
He looks just like me.

00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:40.560
Is he the Ute that Yuzu was talking about?

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:45.060
Lightning Disobey of Rebellion!

00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:52.760
Sora!

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:54.980
Are you okay, Sora?

00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:58.380
Go away!  This doesn't involve you, Yuya!

00:00:58.380 --> 00:01:00.040
What are you talking about?

00:01:00.040 --> 00:01:02.410
You're so hurt that you need 
to stay at the hospital,

00:01:02.410 --> 00:01:04.900
so why would you escape and duel?

00:01:10.520 --> 00:01:15.850
Implementing mass into Solid 
Vision has created Action Duels.

00:01:16.190 --> 00:01:21.070
In duels where the field, monsters 
and duelists become one,

00:01:21.070 --> 00:01:24.060
the people are caught in 
a frenzy of excitement!

00:01:25.580 --> 00:01:28.330
Let's start!  From an instant flash

00:01:28.330 --> 00:01:31.090
Let's find!  Yeah, the way I ought to go

00:01:31.090 --> 00:01:33.760
Let's start!  The fun is only getting started

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:36.560
Ready go!  The real beginning

00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:47.650
A future filled with hope 
and anxiety now begins

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:53.120
Don't worry because you have firm desires

00:01:53.510 --> 00:01:58.750
I fight to reach the day that I yearn for

00:01:58.980 --> 00:02:02.860
The gleaming strength resides inside the card

00:02:03.850 --> 00:02:06.800
Repeating Up/Down

00:02:06.800 --> 00:02:09.160
Feel It!  The heartbeat Bu,Bu,Bu,Burn!

00:02:09.160 --> 00:02:16.410
I become stronger by overcoming 
and shaking off limitations again

00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:19.870
Because I don't want to give up

00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:24.850
Ride the accelerating wind and head towards

00:02:25.270 --> 00:02:31.950
My dream that makes me love tomorrow

00:02:31.950 --> 00:02:42.460
Break through those clouds and draw 
your dazzling dreams in the blue sky

00:02:42.460 --> 00:02:45.140
Let's start!  From an instant flash

00:02:45.140 --> 00:02:47.840
Let's find!  Yeah, the way I ought to go

00:02:47.840 --> 00:02:50.660
Let's start!  The fun is only getting started

00:02:50.660 --> 00:02:53.410
Ready go!  The real beginning

00:02:58.160 --> 00:03:03.030
Resonating Dragons

00:03:04.140 --> 00:03:07.630
He said that if I wanted to save 
Ruri, I had to destroy Fusion.

00:03:07.900 --> 00:03:08.930
Ruri...

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:15.660
A tiny crack can lead to the 
destruction of a giant building.

00:03:16.280 --> 00:03:22.400
You will be the tiny crack that will 
destroy the wall known as Fusion.

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:29.490
Sora Shiunin has valuable 
information about Academia.

00:03:29.720 --> 00:03:31.800
You can't let him continue!

00:03:31.800 --> 00:03:33.060
Stop it!

00:03:34.140 --> 00:03:38.080
I won't allow you to hurt my friend!

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:42.070
If you want to battle, I'll be your opponent!

00:03:42.300 --> 00:03:45.000
Battle Royal Mode.  Joining.

00:03:47.810 --> 00:03:48.840
My turn!

00:03:51.780 --> 00:03:58.850
I set the Pendulum Scale with Scale 1 
Stargazer Magician and Scale 8 Timegazer Magician!

00:04:02.780 --> 00:04:06.430
Now I can summon monsters between 
Level 2 and 7 simultaneously!

00:04:06.900 --> 00:04:09.390
Swing, my soul's pendulum!

00:04:09.700 --> 00:04:12.160
Draw an arc of light in the sky!

00:04:12.360 --> 00:04:14.100
Pendulum Summon!

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:18.300
Appear, the heroic one with 
beautiful different-colored eyes!

00:04:18.600 --> 00:04:21.060
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:04:26.400 --> 00:04:30.250
What?  My body feels hot.

00:04:49.420 --> 00:04:52.620
It's like the two dragons 
are talking to each other.

00:04:55.120 --> 00:04:55.870
Let's battle!

00:04:56.540 --> 00:05:01.980
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon attacks 
Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon!

00:05:02.200 --> 00:05:06.260
Both dragons have 2500 attack points.

00:05:06.260 --> 00:05:08.160
He's fine with mutual destruction?

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:08.880
No.

00:05:09.120 --> 00:05:11.800
Odd-Eyes is a Pendulum Monster.

00:05:11.800 --> 00:05:14.960
Even if it's destroyed, it 
returns to the Extra Deck.

00:05:15.680 --> 00:05:18.730
Yuya Sakaki isn't being reckless.

00:05:37.760 --> 00:05:41.560
I activate the Continuous Trap 
Phantom Knights' Fog Blade!

00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:45.100
Its effect negates your attack.

00:05:48.640 --> 00:05:54.200
As long as I have this card, Odd-Eyes 
Pendulum Dragon can't attack!

00:05:56.560 --> 00:05:59.370
A trap that stops attacks?

00:05:59.980 --> 00:06:05.940
Since he had that set card, he could've 
stopped my Frightfur Bear's attack.

00:06:08.420 --> 00:06:14.760
In order to Xyz Summon for a second 
time, he decided to take the attack.

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:21.460
You successfully Xyz Summoned 
because you persuaded me to attack!

00:06:21.680 --> 00:06:26.530
But you didn't use your remaining 
Overlay Unit during that attack!

00:06:27.160 --> 00:06:32.400
How dare you keep making a fool of me!

00:06:32.760 --> 00:06:35.140
I won't forgive you!

00:06:35.860 --> 00:06:37.380
Ever!

00:06:43.800 --> 00:06:47.590
I activate Timegazer 
Magician's Pendulum effect!

00:06:47.750 --> 00:06:51.470
Once per turn, when a trap is 
played on a Pendulum Monster,

00:06:51.470 --> 00:06:54.300
its activation and effects are negated.

00:06:54.300 --> 00:06:56.220
Inverse Gear Width!

00:07:03.290 --> 00:07:04.290
All right!

00:07:04.290 --> 00:07:08.140
I activate the trap Booby Trap E!

00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:14.400
This card gains a set 
Continuous Trap's effects.

00:07:15.860 --> 00:07:19.750
It gains the effects of the trap that 
Timegazer's Pendulum effect negated.

00:07:20.420 --> 00:07:26.880
Yes.  Due to Phantom Knights' Fog 
Blade's effect, your attack is negated.

00:07:27.320 --> 00:07:33.600
As long as this card is on the 
field, your Dragon can't attack.

00:07:35.060 --> 00:07:37.700
I end my turn.

00:07:38.340 --> 00:07:41.340
If you can't do anything, get out of here!

00:07:42.220 --> 00:07:43.060
Sora?

00:07:43.060 --> 00:07:46.550
He's my prey!  Don't interfere, Yuya!

00:07:46.800 --> 00:07:49.560
Prey?  Say what?

00:07:49.560 --> 00:07:50.780
What are you talking about?

00:07:51.980 --> 00:07:53.400
Answer me, Sora!

00:07:54.050 --> 00:07:58.430
You said the same thing during 
your duel against Kurosaki!

00:07:59.140 --> 00:08:01.760
That they were prey in a hunting game!

00:08:02.580 --> 00:08:09.380
Yuzu told me that your team 
kidnapped Kurosaki's sister Ruri!

00:08:12.620 --> 00:08:14.760
Yuzu said that?

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:18.400
She said that she heard it from Ute.

00:08:20.480 --> 00:08:24.450
Is it true?  Answer me!

00:08:24.660 --> 00:08:26.530
You're Ute, right?

00:08:27.260 --> 00:08:28.420
That's right.

00:08:28.920 --> 00:08:32.120
Tell me.  What really happened?

00:08:32.580 --> 00:08:36.030
Why do you have to hate each other so much?

00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:40.170
Why won't you say anything?

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:41.830
Answer me!

00:08:43.340 --> 00:08:45.430
He can't answer.

00:08:46.300 --> 00:08:51.360
Because if he answers, he'll 
have to admit how weak they are.

00:08:53.440 --> 00:08:54.420
What?

00:08:59.460 --> 00:09:01.950
He's a loser refugee.

00:09:03.260 --> 00:09:08.930
He fled from the Xyz Dimension 
when my team took it over!

00:09:09.160 --> 00:09:10.530
Xyz Dimension?

00:09:10.530 --> 00:09:13.670
Be quiet!  You haven't conquered us!

00:09:14.180 --> 00:09:16.820
Syun and I didn't flee!

00:09:17.960 --> 00:09:22.110
We came to this world to fight 
against Fusion Dimension!

00:09:22.930 --> 00:09:24.600
Fusion Dimension?

00:09:25.260 --> 00:09:30.430
What's a Xyz Dimension or a Fusion Dimension?

00:09:30.430 --> 00:09:34.420
He and Kurosaki aren't from this world.

00:09:34.860 --> 00:09:39.200
They came from Xyz Dimension.  
From a different world.

00:09:39.400 --> 00:09:40.890
A different world?

00:09:41.540 --> 00:09:46.230
My teammates bravely fought 
and defeated Xyz Dimension.

00:09:46.230 --> 00:09:50.370
If I lose, I tarnish the 
glory of my teammates!

00:09:50.930 --> 00:09:54.340
I won't be able to forgive myself!

00:09:54.340 --> 00:09:57.810
Since I was the best in 
Academia's advanced class,

00:09:58.200 --> 00:10:00.850
I was selected for a special mission!

00:10:01.420 --> 00:10:06.330
There's no way I'll lose to a Xyz loser!

00:10:06.600 --> 00:10:08.050
My turn!

00:10:08.230 --> 00:10:10.790
Stop!  If you continue...

00:10:11.180 --> 00:10:15.400
I activate Designer Frightfur 
that I set earlier!

00:10:15.800 --> 00:10:20.430
It lets me Special Summon Edge 
Imp Tomahawk from my graveyard

00:10:20.430 --> 00:10:21.960
and treat it as a Frightfur monster!

00:10:22.730 --> 00:10:28.350
I also activate Edge Imp Frightfuloid's 
effect from my graveyard

00:10:28.350 --> 00:10:31.000
to treat it like a Frightfur monster!

00:10:31.920 --> 00:10:36.180
I activate Frightfur Fusion from my hand!

00:10:36.520 --> 00:10:40.170
I Fusion Summon using Edge 
Imp Tomahawk on my field

00:10:40.170 --> 00:10:44.860
and Frightfuloid and Frightfur 
Bear in my graveyard!

00:10:46.420 --> 00:10:52.860
I'll show you my true power 
that I cultivated at Academia!

00:10:53.070 --> 00:10:58.540
I'll use the real Fusion Summon to 
bring out the most powerful monster!

00:11:05.780 --> 00:11:08.750
Stop!  I don't want to go home yet!

00:11:08.960 --> 00:11:09.700
Sora?

00:11:09.700 --> 00:11:21.160
Wait!  I can't return to Academia 
until I defeat that Xyz user!

00:11:24.600 --> 00:11:25.760
Sora?

00:11:26.250 --> 00:11:27.180
Sora!

00:11:27.630 --> 00:11:29.370
What happened?

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:31.640
What just happened?

00:11:32.640 --> 00:11:34.780
He fled through dimensions.

00:11:34.780 --> 00:11:40.480
He didn't flee.  It looked 
like he was forced to go home.

00:11:41.040 --> 00:11:48.420
His Duel Disk was programmed to 
activate if his identity was revealed.

00:11:49.680 --> 00:11:51.960
He returned to the Fusion Dimension.

00:11:51.960 --> 00:11:53.260
Returned?

00:11:53.520 --> 00:11:54.490
Yeah.

00:11:54.920 --> 00:11:58.700
He's originally from the other world.

00:11:58.930 --> 00:12:00.700
Other world?

00:12:01.640 --> 00:12:04.160
You're speaking nonsense!

00:12:04.420 --> 00:12:10.180
Sora is from the Fusion Dimension, and you 
and Kurosaki are from the Xyz Dimension?

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:14.600
You're saying that there are 
other worlds than this one?

00:12:14.600 --> 00:12:15.650
That's right.

00:12:15.860 --> 00:12:19.680
Stop joking!  I don't believe that!

00:12:19.680 --> 00:12:21.730
Give Sora back now!

00:12:21.730 --> 00:12:24.620
He's hurt from his battle against Kurosaki!

00:12:24.940 --> 00:12:26.500
Don't worry about that.

00:12:26.500 --> 00:12:29.200
Academia has doctors.

00:12:29.200 --> 00:12:30.600
Academia?

00:12:31.360 --> 00:12:33.770
Sora said that name too.

00:12:34.130 --> 00:12:36.770
What's Academia?

00:12:37.960 --> 00:12:44.610
Academia is a training school in the Fusion 
Dimension that creates duel warriors.

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:47.240
Duel warriors?

00:13:10.360 --> 00:13:15.410
After we were notified by the students, 
we immediately hospitalized him.

00:13:15.640 --> 00:13:19.760
It seems the program to 
force him home activated.

00:13:19.760 --> 00:13:22.600
His identity may have been revealed 
while battling the enemy-

00:13:22.600 --> 00:13:24.960
Standard isn't the enemy.

00:13:26.660 --> 00:13:28.130
Forgive me.

00:13:28.720 --> 00:13:34.500
We'll find out what happened 
by examining his memories.

00:13:35.300 --> 00:13:39.660
Yes.  I'll begin preparations 
immediately, Professor.

00:13:57.320 --> 00:14:01.320
Since Sora Shiunin is gone, it's my turn.

00:14:02.280 --> 00:14:05.960
But I no longer have any reason to duel.

00:14:07.160 --> 00:14:11.200
I activate the Quick-Play 
Spell Emergency Provisions.

00:14:11.760 --> 00:14:15.300
For every spell or trap card on my 
field that I send to the graveyard,

00:14:15.830 --> 00:14:19.180
I gain 1000 life points.

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:22.210
I end my turn.

00:14:22.440 --> 00:14:23.930
Why did you do that?

00:14:23.930 --> 00:14:28.740
Without your trap's effect, 
my Odd-Eyes can attack you.

00:14:29.830 --> 00:14:31.680
Do what you want.

00:14:34.160 --> 00:14:35.420
I can't do that!

00:14:44.440 --> 00:14:50.640
You said that you'll make Sora into the 
tiny crack that will destroy Fusion World.

00:14:50.730 --> 00:14:56.060
But now that Sora is gone, 
aren't you actually relieved?

00:14:56.700 --> 00:15:01.380
In your duel against Sora, you could've 
won if you used two Overlay Units.

00:15:01.780 --> 00:15:07.100
But you only used one and tried to end the 
duel by just destroying Sora's monster.

00:15:09.400 --> 00:15:12.960
I don't think you actually want to fight.

00:15:13.260 --> 00:15:17.800
Academia are invaders.

00:15:18.440 --> 00:15:24.500
They overran the Xyz Dimension and took 
my teammates and my friend's sister.

00:15:25.780 --> 00:15:28.960
They attacked our homeland...

00:15:28.960 --> 00:15:30.910
...and turned it into a battlefield.

00:15:33.100 --> 00:15:37.180
Xyz Dimension is your homeland?

00:15:37.700 --> 00:15:40.030
That's what Academia calls it.

00:15:40.600 --> 00:15:48.580
Similar to how they use Fusion Summon, all 
the duelists in our world use Xyz Summon.

00:15:49.880 --> 00:15:54.100
But it's not supposed to be a tool for war.

00:15:54.360 --> 00:15:58.920
When we duel, everyone smiles 
and enjoys themselves.

00:15:58.920 --> 00:16:05.100
That's how it was until 
the day Academia attacked.

00:16:06.150 --> 00:16:09.730
Until then, Heartland was 
overflowing with smiles.

00:17:02.140 --> 00:17:06.600
They turned people into 
cards one after another.

00:17:18.280 --> 00:17:19.660
Big brother?

00:17:20.700 --> 00:17:27.330
I still don't believe that people would 
use dueling to invade another world.

00:17:27.720 --> 00:17:31.800
You think it doesn't concern you 
because it's happening far away?

00:17:31.800 --> 00:17:35.560
What you can see isn't everything.

00:17:35.880 --> 00:17:39.810
Many things are happening in 
places that you can't see.

00:17:40.180 --> 00:17:46.010
I've seen people turned into 
cards with my own eyes.

00:17:47.520 --> 00:17:51.800
Are there really worlds 
we know nothing about?

00:17:51.800 --> 00:17:54.330
Fusion Dimension and Xyz Dimension exist?

00:17:56.330 --> 00:17:58.440
Does that mean...

00:17:58.800 --> 00:18:04.940
Yes.  There's also a Synchro Dimension.

00:18:08.260 --> 00:18:13.160
It's a mystery why the worlds have been 
separated based on summoning method.

00:18:13.380 --> 00:18:17.660
But there's no doubt that it's true.

00:18:18.080 --> 00:18:19.600
What about here?

00:18:19.600 --> 00:18:22.720
What's my world called?

00:18:23.720 --> 00:18:25.100
Standard.

00:18:25.740 --> 00:18:28.720
That's what Academia calls it.

00:18:28.720 --> 00:18:30.500
Standard?

00:18:31.090 --> 00:18:32.860
The foundation for everything.

00:18:32.860 --> 00:18:35.760
It means it's the central world.

00:18:55.680 --> 00:19:01.800
Fusion, Xyz, Synchro, Standard.

00:19:03.460 --> 00:19:06.070
The world has been separated 
into four dimensions,

00:19:06.800 --> 00:19:10.300
and Fusion Dimension is 
invading Xyz Dimension.

00:19:10.920 --> 00:19:14.270
Why did this happen?

00:19:15.320 --> 00:19:18.440
It's due to Leo Akaba's ambitions.

00:19:20.180 --> 00:19:24.000
I don't know anything about dimensions.

00:19:24.000 --> 00:19:26.160
But there's one thing I do know!

00:19:26.940 --> 00:19:29.110
Dueling isn't a tool for war!

00:19:30.440 --> 00:19:32.800
Using duels to invade?

00:19:33.360 --> 00:19:40.290
The duel that I believe in is entertainment 
to make people smile and be happy!

00:19:43.160 --> 00:19:45.460
I still remember clearly.

00:19:46.300 --> 00:19:50.370
My father united everyone through dueling!

00:19:56.580 --> 00:20:00.730
My dad honed Action Duels so 
that it would have the power

00:20:01.310 --> 00:20:05.060
to capture the people's 
attention and make them smile.

00:20:06.360 --> 00:20:10.020
I also feel that I'm getting 
closer to doing that.

00:20:10.240 --> 00:20:15.860
As you can see, there are no 
monsters or set cards on my field.

00:20:15.860 --> 00:20:20.980
My next draw will be the draw of 
destiny with everything on the line!

00:20:21.160 --> 00:20:23.740
Make sure to applaud if I'm successful!

00:20:27.660 --> 00:20:29.600
I draw!

00:20:32.430 --> 00:20:33.550
It's here!

00:20:33.550 --> 00:20:35.940
I'm getting really excited!

00:20:35.940 --> 00:20:38.020
I don't care who wins anymore!

00:20:44.120 --> 00:20:45.210
What?

00:20:48.400 --> 00:20:50.060
It's beautiful.

00:20:50.860 --> 00:20:52.600
Wow!

00:20:56.100 --> 00:21:00.140
That's the entertainment 
dueling that I believe in!

00:21:01.240 --> 00:21:05.950
I won't allow dueling to 
be used to hurt people!

00:21:07.020 --> 00:21:08.100
You...

00:21:11.460 --> 00:21:12.400
What is it?

00:21:16.100 --> 00:21:17.980
What happened?

00:21:17.980 --> 00:21:20.060
The feed has been severed!

00:21:20.060 --> 00:21:23.220
All the cameras in the 
area aren't responding!

00:21:23.220 --> 00:21:24.630
What?

00:21:33.560 --> 00:21:35.720
Ouch...

00:21:37.440 --> 00:21:41.060
Sheesh, why is this here?

00:21:44.060 --> 00:21:45.580
Sheesh!

00:21:48.780 --> 00:21:49.960
You're...

00:21:52.000 --> 00:21:53.500
You!

00:21:53.720 --> 00:21:55.490
I finally found you!

00:21:55.490 --> 00:21:57.120
I've been looking for you!

00:22:00.560 --> 00:22:03.940
There are two people who look like me?

00:22:31.410 --> 00:22:36.040
As long as there's a smile

00:22:38.280 --> 00:22:42.820
I'll risk my ultimate pride

00:22:45.250 --> 00:22:48.120
I always believe

00:22:48.290 --> 00:22:51.640
In my tomorrow

00:22:51.990 --> 00:22:57.270
With courageous wingsJust fly away!

00:23:00.540 --> 00:23:05.910
This duel of the soul (Break through 
the darkness with the miracle card!)

00:23:05.910 --> 00:23:12.790
A battle that surpasses clashing dimensions 
(The fun is only getting started!)

00:23:12.950 --> 00:23:19.450
For everyone to acquire their own dreams

00:23:19.990 --> 00:23:23.520
We go towards the mightiest future

00:23:49.760 --> 00:23:52.960
A duelist riding a motorcycle 
appears in front of us.

00:23:52.960 --> 00:23:55.230
He's Fusion's minion, Hugo!

00:23:55.530 --> 00:23:58.350
Why does he also look like me?

00:23:58.350 --> 00:24:01.420
And he also duels while riding a motorcycle?

00:24:01.420 --> 00:24:04.790
He Synchro Summons a white dragon.

00:24:05.330 --> 00:24:10.360
What am I feeling?  My chest burns!

00:24:11.100 --> 00:24:14.700
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! 
